# Double Consciousness Media (DCM)

Official website for **Double Consciousness Media** — a digital strategy and technical SEO consultancy.

## 🚀 Services
- Technical SEO & Site Hygiene
- Local SEO & Google Business Profile Optimization
- Paid Search & Performance Media
- Digital Strategy & Analytics Dashboards

## 📦 Built With
- React + Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Deployed via GitHub Pages / Vercel

## Run Locally

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
